flowchart TB
    I[Issue or Task Contract]
    R[Repository Baseline]
    E[Execution Environment]
    A[AI Agent]
    C[Code Changes]
    V[Build and Validation]
    P[Pull Request]
    H[Human Review]
    D[Decision]

    I --> A
    R --> A
    E --> A
    A --> C
    C --> V

    V -->|Failure| A
    V -->|Evidence| P

    P --> H
    H -->|Correction Required| A
    H -->|Accept| D
